  "title": "Chocolate Mint Cheese Pie",
  "description": "A luscious cream cheese filling is poured into a graham cracker crust and topped with chopped, frozen chocolate-covered mint candies (Junior Mints Candies). This sweet and decadent dessert is then baked and chilled overnight before serving.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
